export anchor MonoNumbersStyle:
    number: 207
    screen: ProjectsDashboard
    name: Mono numbers
    idea: A crisp sans interface where every number, date and ID is set in a monospace, so columns align like a ledger and figures read as data.
    base: light
    palette:
        white: #ffffff, the page, panels and fields
        fog: #f4f4f6, the sidebar and table heads
        ink: #18181f, text, the logo tile and the chart axis
        graphite: #565667, labels, row numbers, times and axis text
        line: #e1e1e8, borders and rules, never text
        violet: #4b3fc4, the primary button, links, progress, the this week line and focus
        violetTint: #eeedfb, the focus halo, the avatar and a focused row
        pewter: #8f8fa3, the dashed last week line, never text
        green: #17693f, On track with a ring and centre dot
        amber: #875000, At risk with an outlined triangle
        red: #b3202b, Behind with a filled square and down arrow and the overdue flag
    type:
        Words use system-ui, Segoe UI, Roboto, Helvetica Neue, Arial,
        sans-serif. Every number, date, ID and time uses ui-monospace, SF
        Mono, Cascadia Mono, JetBrains Mono, Menlo, Consolas, Liberation
        Mono, monospace with tabular and slashed zero figures, zero padded
        where it helps alignment, as in 01, 07 and 09/10. The greeting is
        24px sans at 650, sidebar KPI values 20px mono semibold, section
        titles 15px sans at 650, body 14px sans, table numbers 13px mono and
        group labels 11px sans capitals tracked 0.08em.
    layout:
        A 248px fog sidebar on the left holds the brand with a dark B slash
        tile, the six nav links where Home is a white tile with a hairline
        ring, and a This week group showing the four KPIs as a white ledger
        list with the label left and the mono value right, overdue in red.
        The top bar holds a search field with a slash key hint, the violet
        New project button, a bell and the user. The main column opens
        with the greeting and mono date on the left and a red overdue flag
        on the right. Next a full width bordered Projects table with a row
        number, Project, Team, Done percent with a mini bar, Tasks as
        18/25, Due as 14 Nov, Days left and Status, all numbers right
        aligned in mono, and a mono totals footer. Below, two panels side
        by side. The left is a line chart overlaying both weeks by weekday,
        this week solid violet with dots and last week dashed grey with
        squares, over a small mono table of the fourteen values and their
        totals. The right is Recent activity as a timeline with a mono time
        gutter such as 12m, 40m and 1h behind a vertical rule. Below 1100px
        the panels stack. Below 820px the sidebar becomes a top block with
        nav in a three column grid and the ledger two by two, and the table
        scrolls inside its panel.
    spacing: A 4px base with steps of 8, 12, 16 and 24px. Table cells have 16px side padding.
    density: Medium high. 40px table rows with numbers in aligned columns.
    corners: 6px on panels, buttons and fields, 4px on code chips and keys.
    borders: 1px cool grey around every panel and between rows, with fog table heads.
    shadows: None, apart from a 1px ring on the current nav item.
    icons:
        1.7px outline icons at 18px. Status uses a ring with a centre dot
        for On track, an outlined triangle with a bang for At risk and a
        filled rounded square with a white down arrow for Behind.
    focus: A 2px violet outline offset 2px. Fields get a violet border and a 3px violet tint halo. Rows get the violet tint fill.
    tone: Precise and short, such as Days left, Latest first and a sigma for totals.
